# OverKartDecomp

Read **`AGENTS.md`** first. RAM: `docs/memory_map.md`. Host contract: `docs/host_overrides.md`.

Working clone of the mk64 decomp with OverKart Library linked natively (one IDO toolchain). This tree’s host is OverKart5 (`src/OverKart5/`).

Do **not** edit KimuraDecomp. Sibling `Library/` is historical GCC/Armips copy source only.

## Hard constraints

- Approval then review on every file change. `.cursor/rules/require-approval.mdc`.
- `src/OverKartLibrary/` must be identical across AmpedUpDecomp, OverKartDecomp, and LibraryDecomp. Do not fork it. `.cursor/rules/shared-overkart-library.mdc`.
- Prefer the original working implementation. `.cursor/rules/prefer-original-implementation.mdc`.
- IDO only. `COMPARE=0`, `AVOID_UB=1`. NTSC custom courses. `ok_HeaderROM` `0xBE9178`.
- Do not relocate FB or Z. Defaults body is `src/OverKart5/OverKartDefaults.c`, not inside Library.
- Never commit `Code/Protec/Cheat.c`. `GameOffsets.asm` is stock RAM, not live.
- End lengthy replies with `---` then one short summary paragraph.
